<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</title>
<headline>Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Here is a list of the minimum FOB reference prices for exporting 100-lb (45.36-kilo) sacks of Ecuadorean cocoa and cocoa products, effective Nov 7-13:</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Epoca......................$ 56.21</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer.....................$ 59.86</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer Select..............$ 61.55</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer Plantation Select...$ 64.64</p>
<p>    Cocoa butter...............................$155.43</p>
<p>    Residual butter............................$116.58</p>
<p>    Unsweeten or bitter cocoa,</p>
<p>    Cocoa liquor or paste......................$ 82.11</p>
<p>    Cocoa cake.................................$ 20.84</p>
<p>    Residual natural cake......................$  2.08</p>
<p>    Cocoa powder...............................$ 23.09</p>
</text>
